      "kind": "INSTR_ACTION",
      "operation": "file.read",
      "resource": "unknown",
      "summary": "- **Close-up beat device**: the device itself once unboxed and powered on. `@Image2` is typically a real photo of the device's screen at its key UI moment (first measurement, paired status, hero feature open); if the device has no screen, a clean hero photo of it mid-use.",
