    {
      "id": "n0020",
      "kind": "INSTR_ACTION",
      "operation": "file.read",
      "resource": "unknown",
      "summary": "Return JSON only: { \\\"visible_text_ocr\\\": string[], \\\"brand_visible\\\": boolean, \\\"spec_visible\\\": boolean, \\\"observations\\\": string[] }. OCR/read all visible text. brand_visible is true only if the exact expected brand text above is readable. spec_visible is true if expected spec text is empty or the exact expected spec text above is readable.\"",
